cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use a2swe in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "a2swe: Anything to SWE Agent Orchestrated Explainer Videos"
type: software
authors:
    alias: dayour
repository-code: "https://github.com/dayour/a2swe"
url: "https://github.com/dayour/a2swe"
abstract: >-
  A Claude Code / Codex skill that turns topics or source material into narrated
  motion-graphics explainer videos in English. A parallel domain-expert
  software-engineering agent track manages the full pipeline and ships with each video's
  project as a reusable artifact for revisions and follow-up videos. Every frame is drawn in code
  with Remotion (React + TypeScript). Ships a compilable template, primitives and lighting
  library, voiceover / storyboard / render / QC tooling, written style and motion specs,
  a multi-agent build protocol and an English production quality contract.
keywords:
  - claude-code
  - codex
  - agent-skill
  - remotion
  - explainer-video
  - motion-graphics
  - text-to-video
  - tts
  - multi-agent
